@startuml
title Morpho Vault V2 - in-kind redemption with forceDeallocate
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF5FF
  ParticipantBorderColor #4A78B5
}
participant Depositor as U
participant "Flash lender" as F
participant "Blue market" as M
participant "Adapter" as A
participant "VaultV2" as V
U -> F : flash-borrow X
U -> M : supply X (own account)
U -> V : forceDeallocate(adapter, market, X, U)
V -> A : deallocate(X)
A -> M : withdraw X
A --> V : X back to idle
V -> V : burn U's shares worth X * penalty\n(assets stay in vault)
U -> V : withdraw(X)
V --> U : X
U -> F : repay X
note over U, M : U now holds X of supply in the market
@enduml
